<title>HONG KONG: Trade in Singapore HK Prop shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Singapore HK Prop shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Singapore Hong Kong Properties Investment Ltd was suspended on Wednesday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The shares surged HK$0.925 to a year high of HK$4.025 before trading was suspended at 2.50 p.m. (0650 GMT).</p>
<p>Turnover was 1.97 million shares worth HK$7.20 million.</p>
<p>The property company said last month its controlling shareholder Eastlite Industries Ltd was in talks to sell control of the company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
